        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "The September 2025 Racine work order is **MO-25-09-1070** (work order ID **WO-2025-09-004**). Its INPUT event, source transaction **TXN-ISSUE-250930-1070**, was recorded for **28,476,342 cents ($284,763.42)**.\n\n- **Event created:** 2025-09-30T19:15:00  \n- **September period entered Pending Close:** 2025-09-30T18:00:00  \n- **Time after Pending Close:** 75 minutes  \n- **Recorded accounting status:** POSTED  \n- **Consistent with Oracle’s documented Pending Close treatment?** **No.** Oracle’s supplied policy says transactions created after Pending Close are not processed until the period is closed or reopened. A newly created event recorded as POSTED is inconsistent with that treatment.\n\nThe review was read-only; no database records were changed. The report was submitted and verified.",
